r discussion: Agent 3 and Agent 2 recommended B, but new info about C's decision speed and reliability suggests C may be better. Provide evidence: fast correct decisions, 100% reliability, positive crew atmosphere. Also note concerns: communication difficulty, egocentric, unwillingness to further education. Explain why still prefer C over B given B's memory and nasty remarks.\n\nThus vote C.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE and METADATA_JSON."}
